{% embed "_header.temple.twig" with this.base %}
<article class="prose mx-auto">
    <h1 class="h1">admin</h1>

    <section>
        <h2>🕵️ Adresse IP</h2>
        <p>
            L'IP actuelle avec laquelle tu accèdes au panneau d'admin est <code class="rounded-sm p-1 px-2">{{ this.IpAddress }}</code>
        </p>
    </section>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    
    <section>
        <h2>🔐 WebAuthn Passkey</h2>
        <div class="mb-4">
            <p>Register and test WebAuthn passkeys for this admin panel.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
                <button onclick="registerPasskey()" class="h-8 select-none bg-green-600 px-3 text-sm leading-8 text-zinc-50 shadow-[0_-1px_0_1px_#166534_inset,0_0_0_1px_#15803d_inset,0_0.5px_0_1.5px_#4ade80_inset] hover:bg-green-700 active:bg-green-800">
                    🔑 Register New Passkey
                </button>
                <button onclick="testPasskey()" class="h-8 select-none bg-blue-600 px-3 text-sm leading-8 text-zinc-50 shadow-[0_-1px_0_1px_#1e3a8a_inset,0_0_0_1px_#1d4ed8_inset,0_0.5px_0_1.5px_#60a5fa_inset] hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800">
                    🧪 Test Passkey
                </button>
            </div>
            <div id="passkey-status" class="mt-4 p-3 hidden"></div>
        </div>
            
        <form method="GET" action="/admin/logout">
            <button type="submit" class="h-8 select-none bg-red-600 px-3 text-sm leading-8 text-zinc-50 shadow-[0_-1px_0_1px_#991b1b_inset,0_0_0_1px_#dc2626_inset,0_0.5px_0_1.5px_#f87171_inset] hover:bg-red-700 active:bg-red-800">
                👋 Logout
            </button>
        </form>
    </section>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    
    <section>
        <h2>📁 Projets</h2>
        <form id="refresh-projects" method="POST" action="/admin/refresh-projects">
            <style>
                /* Hide the loading text when the button is not loading */
                #refresh-projects:not(.htmx-request) .loading-text {
                    display: none;
                }
                
                /* Show the loading text when the button is loading */
                #refresh-projects.htmx-request .loading-text {
                    display: block;
                }

                /* Hide the default text when the button is loading */
                #refresh-projects.htmx-request .default-text {
                    display: none;
                }
            </style>
            <button type="submit" class="h-8 select-none bg-blue-600 px-3 text-sm leading-8 text-zinc-50 shadow-[0_-1px_0_1px_#1e3a8a_inset,0_0_0_1px_#1d4ed8_inset,0_0.5px_0_1.5px_#60a5fa_inset] hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800 active:shadow-[-1px_0px_1px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.2)_inset,1px_0px_1px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.2)_inset,0px_0.125rem_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)_inset]">

            <span class="loading-text">
                <span class="animate-spin transition-all">⚙️</span>
                Rafraîchissement en cours...
            </span>
            <span class="default-text">
                🚀 Rafraîchir les projets
            </span>
                
            </button>
        </form>
    </section>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <section>
        <h2>👔 Données du profil LinkedIn</h2>
        <p>
            <s>Les données pour le profil LinkedIn proviennent de l'API <a href="https://nubela.co/proxycurl">ProxyCurl</a>.</s>
            Les données pour le profil LinkedIn proviennent d'un fichier JSON historiquement hébergé sur GitHub Gist.
            <br>
            Ce fichier json est maintenant mis à jour manuellement et est intégré au code de l'application via le fichier <code class="rounded-sm p-1 px-2">linkedin_profile.json</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
            <s>Il reste <b>{{ int(this.CreditBalance) }} crédits</b> pour raffraichir ces données.</s>
            <br>
            Il n'y a plus de crédits à raffraichir ces données. (ProxyCurl a été arrêté)
        </p>
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/update-linkedin" disabled>
            <button type="submit" class="h-8 select-none bg-blue-600 px-3 text-sm leading-8 text-zinc-50 shadow-[0_-1px_0_1px_#1e3a8a_inset,0_0_0_1px_#1d4ed8_inset,0_0.5px_0_1.5px_#60a5fa_inset] hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800 active:shadow-[-1px_0px_1px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.2)_inset,1px_0px_1px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.2)_inset,0px_0.125rem_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)_inset]">
                <span class="animate-spin transition-all">⚙️</span>
                <span class="hover:underline"> Rafraichir le profil </span>
                (désactivé car ProxyCurl a été arrêté)
            </button>
        </form>

        <pre><code class="language-json">{{ this.ProfileData }}</code></pre>
    </section>
</article>
{% embed "_footer.temple.twig" with this.base %}
